{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a62cc20b81962dde43103b0876a5a870065537047afe8755224b710742ebf279", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0f1ad76906b0ce1458a207fb227ac551c0a9110c9a990073bcbdc2dcd248c3a6", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nなんだか楽しそうですけど、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n感觉您似乎很开心，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "69d96267b735822c710997b4c69f38f20308d1be4747b75dbb1a1d789a3a3439", "ja": "今ちょっと、お出かけのことを考えて……えへへ。\n5月って、とってもいい季節ですよね？", "zh": "我刚刚在想出门的事……嘿嘿。5月真是个特别好的季节呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "af51e186ba5698cb1f8bf4622e512ace2f2b739c86e36837178750732c20d788", "ja": "桜は終わっちゃいましたけど、緑が綺麗で。\nあったかくなってきて、出かけるのも楽しいですし♪", "zh": "虽然樱花季已经结束了，但绿意盎然的景色也很漂亮。\n天气渐渐暖和起来，出门也很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8a345e21dd823a977db3fdafef40888929622ec15e58962e9cfe7c1200a39e20", "ja": "言われてみれば、そうですね。\n行楽シーズンでもありますし。", "zh": "你这么说，还真是呢。\n而且现在也是出游的好时节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c1af99719f730f3401712c30a02d7bb68cd571b4852e3392e6fe4410c57a557e", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんです♪　過ごしやすいし、\nとってもいい季節だな～なんて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，确实是这样♪ 天气也很舒适，\n真是个特别美好的季节呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "69a4725eaff4c7577a5358c80e3f27a2bc5edb3e9f8abf949fcdf6b1cc69cfa7", "ja": "あっ、いけない！　また忘れちゃうところでした。\n社長さんが、お仕事の話があるって言ってましたよ。", "zh": "啊，不好！差点又忘了。\n社长说有工作上的事情要谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5c3c57c5b7a8f71f0b545d728fec8a056f5c78a9baa5605fe7c3d4b90e9aff8c", "ja": "社長が？\nわかりました、すぐに向かいます。", "zh": "社长找我？\n明白了，我马上过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "796b5d722d096c82f19da6199123cc1d762ed4fcd80b2cc48e13a6bb8b31d27e", "ja": "はい！　やっぱり{$P$}さんって、\nとっても忙しいんですね……。", "zh": "是！果然{$P$}先生真的很忙呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dc49d3d50e30df1677798df9edd79a373b4ff8a07eb84af6b8ec43236269a3aa", "ja": "でも、仕事があるのはいい事ですから！\nそれじゃあ、行ってきます。", "zh": "不过，有工作总归是好事嘛！那我先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1a5631683e690a6faf9d963ddbe0fd72aaea07d4dd33d1adcf2213c29769d27", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃい♪\n頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "好——路上小心♪  \n请加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1012_se", "source_sha256": "3dc399f3ece866d8dc827bd4e1faa17379d122a5630d6a6841bcfd6ec315725a", "ja": "バーンッ！", "zh": "砰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "47c8a318240c0b45910e9cc0e5310bd894139abb87f5fad240932919c6a15c56", "ja": "うわあっ！？", "zh": "唔哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "482649c6bf44f66111eb6c8a1a22e921ae415e6c875455e5c369d2e88afdb866", "ja": "きゃあっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ae8e67322700d0151353631ea7f1f34dc43790284c59774cdcf8ebe8a8c28cd6", "ja": "なんだ、今の音は……それに悲鳴が！\n社長、音無さん！", "zh": "怎么回事，刚才那是什么声音……还有惨叫声！  \n社长，音无小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c5b8e2ec405887331b36ba2db8892e12f86b766f547344d6a788020612c82b91", "ja": "社長、音無さん、無事ですか！\n何があったんですか！", "zh": "社长，音无女士，你们没事吧！\n发生什么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "9b893eafef5e61bbd5b04f927ffa865998309638df79a0119da16b65689f1b17", "ja": "お、おお、君か！　よく来てくれたね。\nいやはや、してやられたよ……。", "zh": "啊、啊，是你啊！你来得正好。\n哎呀呀，真是被你摆了一道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "e749e605f6fbaa8c4790fbbf10220f071be2462843147e8f49a7c87f0b6eb95f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　それが、\nいつの間にか社長の椅子に風船が置かれていて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！其实是这样的，\n社长的椅子不知什么时候被放了气球……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "32d6f52817ed95d9eab85873723ffbfbb4c85467516c39841d41e47237a71b54", "ja": "私が気付かずに、座ってしまったんだよ！\nおそらく、亜美君のイタズラだろう。", "zh": "是我没注意就坐上去了！\n应该是亜美搞的恶作剧吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "844fc69c2be2fadb8f7b96863051cfdbd07822cd2ebadfcc2b4d30010fbe2a98", "ja": "さっきちょうど、廊下ですれ違ったからね。\nいやはや、気付くのが遅かったようだ。", "zh": "刚才正好在走廊擦肩而过。\n哎呀，看来我发现得太晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9c117c833eb4390e222dcd50e8fd6af4132e4f5db19a6eaae7133f4c221608a4", "ja": "な、なんてことを……すみません！\n後で、しっかり注意しておきます。", "zh": "这、这都做了些什么……对不起！\n之后我会好好提醒她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "13a05188c2aa0dcd3e7ce9306a47c66ffc61ab0ccf99c76091e61247c428866a", "ja": "はっはっは、気にしなくていいよ。\nこれくらいのイタズラ、可愛いものだ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，不用在意。\n这种程度的恶作剧，算是很可爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "a2868310c8820635558df28b0ed4f4b468dbb393a805353ff44a1b908ed8cbba", "ja": "社長ったら、最近はイタズラされているのに、\nなんだか楽しそうなんですよ。", "zh": "社长最近明明一直被人捉弄，\n看起来却好像挺乐在其中的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "4f970b02496f65063a7fda7bf6a44aebc60bb325d5d65c3b3b5dfcbe1819464a", "ja": "いやぁ、次はどんなイタズラをされるのかと思うと、\n張り合いがあってね。次こそ見破ってみせるよ！", "zh": "哎呀，一想到下次会被捉弄什么，就觉得干劲十足呢。下次一定要把它识破给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "019e758d1faf0b97f703aab4c6da95796c552f837e10e4108576cd21ca642a96", "ja": "そ、そうですか……応援してます。\nところで社長、お話があるとか？", "zh": "是、是吗……我会给您加油的。\n对了，社长，您说有事要跟我谈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "7f942d181e9b982853ab040d2925145632ef5d75956827de674816ca5072a244", "ja": "おっと、そうだった……うおっほん！\n君は、ミリオンパークという公園を知っているかね？", "zh": "哦，对了……咳咳！\n\n你知道有个叫Million Park的公园吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "080961ccf80c648814a13156ac91ee8f3acfe83ce0d7b8fd04f6fad19456d967", "ja": "ミリオンパーク……。\n確か、郊外にある大きな公園だったような……？", "zh": "Million Park……我记得，好像是郊外的一座大型公园……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "9311e79560c04a4e6cf40ae3ee133f7c420841cc5e44aeeb534d9f9210ddd800", "ja": "大人も楽しめる自然公園として、評判ですね。\n大きなアスレチックがあったりして。", "zh": "作为大人也能尽情畅游的自然公园，口碑很不错呢。\n里面好像还有大型运动游乐设施。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "7826c79690a040265b8d3b82625127e308728fc85151b2759b67cff39523dfd7", "ja": "うむ！　実はこのミリオンパークの園長と、\n最近知り合う機会があってね。", "zh": "嗯！其实我最近有机会结识了\n这家百万乐园的园长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "c2029cc21f7ef12602b34c54e6cb41ac2f4e948b2dda908c76d3879138beb774", "ja": "近々、開園記念日を迎えるそうなんだが……\nその式典に、是非うちのアイドル達をという話なんだ。", "zh": "听说很快就要迎来开园纪念日了……\n他们想邀请我们家的偶像们参加那场典礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ce863c42bea390540c8e98e51c9a4d868bc2793c354a23e42c0915b838f8e703", "ja": "本当ですか！？\nそれは、ありがたい話ですね！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n那可真是件令人感激的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "d65b7c242ed04028baa13a5b8fe78beb9f837bdc86c5abadfd28d2ad6e42f0d7", "ja": "そうだろう？　この話を逃す手はない。\n君にプロデュースをお願いしたいんだが、いいかね？", "zh": "没错吧？可不能错过这件事。\n我想请你来负责制作，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_1033", "source_sha256": "35eb386b774471b2667680bfa88bdfd1d4bab82aa0c8a39b74831082ccf5e796", "ja": "逃しません！", "zh": "不会让你逃掉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "91a6fb4197bcbb0ff87369a0692caac16637d9d7b9b4ad8aba354e96f5fabf1b", "ja": "もちろん、成功させてみせます！　きっと、\nアイドル達の知名度アップにも繋がりますし……。", "zh": "我一定会让它成功的！而且，\n这肯定也能提高偶像们的知名度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "791caa1e53a145a26cb1c81471df71af90a63861515e4851a8920454dfae0eac", "ja": "おお、いい返事だね！　実はもう、\n新しい曲も届いているんだよ。聞いてくれたまえ。", "zh": "哦，答应得真爽快！其实新歌已经送到了。请听听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6b3c6566adc6f1ff5b1fb62a8b0a696b6967e87ca9df29a04f88bd8f50dcfff6", "ja": "これは……\n明るくて、とても楽しそうな曲ですね。", "zh": "这首歌……\n听起来明快又充满欢乐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "614958719099e4e74af688cba7e945ee5ec3a48cea65049135e90da66f7f5c75", "ja": "素敵な曲ですよね♪\nこの曲、公園のCMにも使われるそうですよ。", "zh": "真是一首动听的歌呢♪听说这首歌还会被用在公园的广告里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "d29715d8a063e554a17ff633935149124bffac6216c8cff005b9325a78223133", "ja": "うむ、その予定だ！　メンバー選びは、\n基本、君に一任しようと思うんだが……。", "zh": "嗯，正是如此打算！至于成员的人选，\n基本上，我想全权交给你负责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "4b04ce4a43f2bda620eb87962eb46dfb2c424df694e487301baa6e5ef0e09435", "ja": "さっきのイタズラで、ピンと来てね。亜美君を入れると\nいいんじゃないかと思ったんだが、どうだろう？", "zh": "刚才那个恶作剧让我突然有了灵感。我觉得把亚美也加入进去应该不错，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "eefa7cfcc301692bdce755e83d944fd5533600b9e81241dceb8e046169358e9d", "ja": "そうですね、いい人選だと思います。\n亜美ならこの曲を、楽しく歌ってくれるでしょうし。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得这个人选很合适。\n如果是亚美，她一定会开心地唱这首歌的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "d388ac13987b928587ae2835c2479abc62dda5d46512cbd4191aed624b76b689", "ja": "うむ。きっとみんなを、ビックリさせてくれるだろう！\nでは、よろしく頼んだよ。", "zh": "嗯。他一定会让大家大吃一惊的！\n那么，就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2009_101kot", "source_sha256": "28821bf085e6a3ebedc8f633fdab6cfc1f922de67f5e6bb5fe59c3e3eed1c40c", "ja": "それにしても、ミリオンパークかぁ。\n私も少し前に、遊びに行った事があるんですけど……。", "zh": "话说回来，百万乐园啊。\n我前段时间也去那里玩过，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2010_101kot", "source_sha256": "a526e773a2664ec24181f33a8cbc311d275ee8ddb9b958f2b6d8ece62b34d8db", "ja": "アスレチックがとっても楽しかったんですよね。\nはしゃぎすぎて、筋肉痛になっちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "那里的体育设施特别有意思呢。\n不过因为玩得太尽兴，结果还肌肉酸痛了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2011_president", "source_sha256": "37f448b9c984c855a04a604bd78578b5cb055338613a1e0c3f5debc187487eb6", "ja": "はっはっは。いやあ、\nお互い、無理のきかない年になったものだね、音無君。", "zh": "哈哈哈哈。哎呀，\n我们都到了不能再勉强自己的年纪了啊，小鸟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2012_101kot", "source_sha256": "aef80898b17f9d538f54ada0117c64a8d412162fe18accf23853a67e47214567", "ja": "ピヨッ！？\nわ、私はまだ、若いですからっ！", "zh": "啾！？我、我还年轻着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_intro_2013_p", "source_sha256": "85863b6cba21d890d512adfcb4e2f0d06eb2cfd2855c997a4b4efdcdb0d34c7c", "ja": "（亜美以外のメンバーをどうするか……？\nまずは、思案のしどころだな！）", "zh": "（该怎么安排亚美以外的成员呢……？首先，这可得好好琢磨一番了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
